// HTML Help HH.EXE Suspicious Child Process | T1047, T1059.001, T1059.003, T1059.005, T1059.007, T1218, T1218.001, T1218.010, T1218.011, T1566, T1566.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_hh_html_help_susp_child_process.yml
process.parent.executable.caseless:*\\hh.exe AND (process.executable.caseless:(*\\CertReq.exe OR *\\CertUtil.exe OR *\\cmd.exe OR *\\cscript.exe OR *\\installutil.exe OR *\\MSbuild.exe OR *\\MSHTA.EXE OR *\\msiexec.exe OR *\\powershell.exe OR *\\pwsh.exe OR *\\regsvr32.exe OR *\\rundll32.exe OR *\\schtasks.exe OR *\\wmic.exe OR *\\wscript.exe))
